#!/bin/sh
# 拒绝 AI 工具署名与维护者以外的身份，规则见 docs/workspace/COMMIT_POLICY.md。
msg_file="$1"
status=0

if grep -qiE '^(co-authored-by|co-developed-by|generated-by):[[:space:]]*(claude|codex|chatgpt|copilot|gemini|cursor)' "$msg_file"; then
	printf '%s\n' "commit-msg: 提交信息不得包含 AI 工具署名（docs/workspace/COMMIT_POLICY.md）" >&2
	status=1
fi
if grep -qiE '^claude-session:' "$msg_file"; then
	printf '%s\n' "commit-msg: 提交信息不得包含工具会话标识（docs/workspace/COMMIT_POLICY.md）" >&2
	status=1
fi

# git 不保证把身份导出到钩子环境，统一从 git var 取，命令行 -c 覆盖也生效。
ident_email() {
	git var "$1" 2>/dev/null | sed -n 's/.*<\(.*\)>.*/\1/p'
}
allow='dr-hydra@users.noreply.github.com 116339679+dr-hydra@users.noreply.github.com'
check_identity() {
	label="$1"
	email=$(printf '%s' "$2" | tr '[:upper:]' '[:lower:]')
	case " $allow " in
		*" $email "*) return 0 ;;
	esac
	printf '%s\n' "commit-msg: $label 必须是维护者，当前为 '$2'（docs/workspace/COMMIT_POLICY.md）" >&2
	return 1
}
check_identity "作者" "$(ident_email GIT_AUTHOR_IDENT)" || status=1
check_identity "提交者" "$(ident_email GIT_COMMITTER_IDENT)" || status=1

exit $status
